WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:13.156
The Social inbox brings comments on your posts and your Google reviews into one place, so nothing goes unanswered. In this video, you’ll read what’s waiting, reply with AI, and turn a complaint into a ticket.

00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:23.535
Open Social, and choose Inbox. It brings in comments on the posts Worklynq published, and your Google reviews, and checks for new ones every few minutes.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.899
At the top: what’s waiting, unhappy reviews, how many you’ve replied to, and how fast you usually reply. Filter by channel, or by what still needs a reply.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:41.992
Each one shows where it came from: a Google review, or a comment on Facebook, Instagram or LinkedIn, with the post it was on.

00:00:42.967 --> 00:00:47.660
Lee left an unhappy review this morning, about a slow line. Open it to reply.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:56.953
Write with AI suggests replies in your voice. Pick one, check it, and post it in public as your business. If it needs fixing, make it a ticket.

00:00:57.733 --> 00:01:06.203
Replies are posted in public, as your business, so check each one before you send it. Done without replying clears one that doesn’t need an answer.

